# Logs
# logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Env: `.env.development` / `.env.production` ARE committed on purpose — every VITE_* var
# is public (inlined into the bundle), so they hold no secrets. Only machine-specific
# overrides are ignored, which `*.local` above already covers.
.env
.env.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
config.bat

# Never commit build/source archives — a 6.4 MB `Shipguard-admin.zip` (a redundant snapshot of this
# repo's own src/, referenced by nothing) was tracked here until Plan 29. Note that removing it from
# HEAD does NOT shrink the clone: the blob stays in history and only a rewrite (git filter-repo/BFG)
# would reclaim it — that is destructive and needs coordination, so it was left alone deliberately.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
